# Environment Variables for WebPilot SaaS

## Aurora PostgreSQL (Required)
PGHOST=your-aurora-host.rds.amazonaws.com
PGDATABASE=webpilot
PGUSER=postgres
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_ROLE_ARN=arn:aws:iam::ACCOUNT_ID:role/WebPilotRole

## NextAuth.js (Required)
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=your-secret-key-here

## Google OAuth (Optional for OAuth login)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret

## Supabase (For data migration only - can be removed after migration)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

## Google Analytics (Optional)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA4_PROPERTY_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

## Feature Flags
NODE_ENV=production
